  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gateway, Direct TA and MEL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CLEAN will support UK government officials in 3 ways: 

1. Hosting a Gateway website as a portal to access available guidance and materials on climate and environment mainstreaming, links to other technical assistance facilities in FCDO and as an access point for CLEAN&apos;s wider offer. 
2. Offering Direct Technical Assistance on Paris alignment and wider climate, environment and nature mainstreaming through expert advice and support. 
3. Assessing the UK&apos;s commitment to align all ODA to the Paris agreement through a Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning facility.</narrative>
  </description>
